      "text": "Pick a theme that fits your document"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Every markoto document carries its own theme: fonts, colours, page margins, tables, the cover page. The same theme drives the preview and the PDF, so what you see on the right is what you send.",
